{"id":"c1ec7730895203eb","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-simple-set.md","title":"Simple Set","display":"df-simple-set — Simple Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-simple-set","aliases":["68-df-simple-set"],"display":"df-simple-set — Simple Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§17 definition p.63 / PDF 72","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-simple-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-simple-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-set — Simple Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§17 definition p.63 / PDF 72"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A=\\mathbb N\\setminus A\">\\(\\overline A=\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> 为可数无限基数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span> 为以下引入的集合性质谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land|\\overline A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq\\overline A\\Rightarrow |W_e|&lt;\\aleph_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land|\\overline A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq\\overline A\\Rightarrow |W_e|&lt;\\aleph_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §17，印刷 p.63 / PDF p.72 的定义。定义要求补集无限且没有无限 RE 子集；不是“补集非 RE”这一较弱性质。这里只核对定义陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 与 $W_e$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$\\overline A=\\mathbb N\\setminus A$；$\\aleph_0$ 为可数无限基数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A=\\mathbb N\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land|\\overline A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq\\overline A\\Rightarrow |W_e|<\\aleph_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1082,"backlinks":[{"id":"acc7cf5eb71743a3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[68-df-simple-set]]。"},{"id":"eee858dbcfa90e95","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{HyperSimple}$ 见 [[68-df-hypersimple-set]]，$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[68-df-simple-set]]。"},{"id":"f416b894b72b070a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Simple}$、$\\mathrm{HyperSimple}$ 分别见 [[68-df-simple-set]]、[[68-df-hypersimple-set]]。$W_{e,s}$ 的有限单调枚举见 [[68-df-finite-computation-approximation]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-simple-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-simple-set]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-simple-set|df-simple-set — Simple Set]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039"]}